@startuml

title Connection and nickname

participant Client
participant Server

group transport connection
alt socket
Client->Server: open TCP connection
Server-->Client: object streams ready
else RMI
Client->Server: registry lookup
Server-->Client: RemoteMesosServer stub
end
end

Client->Server: NicknameRequest

alt nickname is available
Server-->Client: GameOperationResult.Nickname(success)
loop every 2 seconds
Client->Server: HeartbeatRequest(lobby)
Server-->Client: GameOperationResult.SimpleOk(success)
end
else nickname belongs to a disconnected player
Server-->Client: GameOperationResult.Nickname(rejoinAvailable = true)
else nickname is already active
Server-->Client: GameOperationResult.Err(PLAYER_NAME_TAKEN)
end

note over Client, Server
The same request API is used by Socket and RMI clients.
Only the transport connection is different.
end note

@enduml
